        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "27.03 The Employer agrees to contribute the sum of $272.57 per month for each special part time employee or $66.43 per month for each regular part time employee to the UFCW Local 1500 Welfare Fund on behalf of each part time employee covered by the Agreement who has completed six (6) consecutive months of regular part time service with the Employer. Contributions shall begin on the first (1st) day of the month following the completion of such period.",
