        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "27.05 The amount of the monthly contributions to the UFCW Local 1500 Welfare Fund and the method of calculation whereby a specific monthly sum is contributed for each class of employee, is a formula for providing gross income to the Fund and bears no relationship to the benefits provided.",
